        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 249,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 Map Changes + Free Kits",
            ["date"] = "05/15/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>Reminder:</b> Next week we will be celebrating BedWars\226\128\153 5th Anniversary with an update! \240\159\142\137\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\170\164Trapper\n\240\159\164\150Vulcan\n\240\159\144\157Beekeeper Beatrix\n\226\154\156\239\184\143Void Knight (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 <b>Map Changes</b>\n<b>Map Fixes</b>\n- Fountain Peaks (Doubles)\n- Desert Storm (Doubles)\n- Shadowfall (Doubles)\n- Vineyard (Squads)\n\n<b>Map Revamps</b>\n- Mystic (Duels)\n- Cistern (SkyWars)\n- Desert Oasis (Squads)\n- Dome (Squads)\n\n<b>New Maps</b>\n- Pagoda (5v5)\n- Cherry Hills (Squads)\n- Shrine (Doubles)\n- Windfall (Doubles)\n- Pinewood (5v5)\n- Deserted Ruins (16v16)\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Whim getting mana refund on hitting blocks\n- Fixed Ragnar Render\n",
