            ["updateLogId"] = 248,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\240\159\143\134 Ranked Season 16 Begins! (5v5)",
            ["date"] = "05/08/2026",
            ["body"] = "\226\140\154 <b>Update Schedule Changes</b>\nWe wanted to give you a quick update on how we\226\128\153ll be handling game updates moving forward. Instead of sticking to a strict weekly update schedule, we\226\128\153re shifting to a more flexible release schedule. This change will help us spend more time polishing content and making sure each update is the best it can be.\nOur next update will be the BedWars\226\128\153 Anniversary Update. \n\n\240\159\143\134 <b>New Ranked Season</b>\nRanked Season 16 starts now! For this ranked season, we\226\128\153ve switched from the squads game mode back to 5v5. Season ends 15 weeks from now on August 21 (8/21/2026).\n\n<b>Ranked Mechanics</b>\n- Block decay\n- Bed Shield: The bed is invulnerable for a short period at the start of the match\n- Kit banning\n- Rank Decay now starts after 2 weeks\n- Updated map pool\n\n<b>\240\159\143\133 Ranked Season 15 Top Players</b>\nCongratulations to the players who reached the top of the Season 15 Ranked leaderboard!\n\240\159\165\135 ian @IANTHEPRIME\n\240\159\165\136 Hyun @Silveros812\n\240\159\165\137 losingmypulse @losingmypulse\n\n\240\159\143\134\194\160<b>Season 15 Ranked Rewards</b>\nSeason 15 Ranked Rewards are now out! Players who finished in Gold rank or higher have received the <b>Victorious Freiya</b> kit skin. Higher-ranked players will get a special version of the skin that matches their rank along with the variants of the ranks below them.\n<b>Rewards</b>\n- Victorious Freiya\n- Title of the rank you reached\n\n\240\159\143\166 <b>Auction Changes</b>\nWe\226\128\153re discontinuing the Clan Auction for individual players (the full clan auction is still available). Any players who made bids this week will still be receiving rewards! Armor trim effects (black flame, void flame, and hellfire flame) are now unlocked in the lucky crate.\n\n\240\159\148\165 <b>New Armor Trim</b>\nWe\226\128\153ve added a new Phoenix Armor Trim! It\226\128\153s available as part of the Elemental Armor Trim Pack, and requires at least 1 other armor trim on a kit before it can be unlocked.\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n\240\159\159\161 Elder tree\n- Automatically picks up orb when near it\n\240\159\159\162 Skoll\n- Mark duration 16\226\134\14620\n- Slightly increased the area to trigger speed boost\n\240\159\159\162 Zarrah\n- Extra 20% damage on the hit that triggers the gun mark\n\240\159\159\162 Whim\n- Gain half of your mana back on hits\n\240\159\159\162 Barbarian\n- Increased rage gain if enemy gear is stronger than barbarian, up to 50%\n\240\159\148\180 Ragnar\n- Ability cooldown 26\226\134\14630\n\240\159\148\180 Davey\n- Cannon Price 40 Iron \226\134\146 50 Iron\n\240\159\148\180 Umbra\n- Travel time increased to 1.5 + 1 seconds per 100 studs\n\240\159\148\180 Lucia\n- Candy amount per damage 55% \226\134\146 45%\n\240\159\148\180 Conqueror (nerf)\n- Healing banner\226\128\153s healing reduced by 5% for each teammate in area\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\148\177Triton\n\240\159\140\180Nahla\n\240\159\148\174Death Addar\n\240\159\145\129\239\184\143Nazar\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed jump boots dealing massive fall damage\n",
