            ["title"] = "Crypt Rework + Ranked Season Extended",
            ["date"] = "05/01/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\240\159\146\128 Crypt Rework</b>\n- Added 2 new Abilities to Necromancer\226\128\153s Staff\n    \n    \240\159\148\174 <b>Recall Skeletons:</b> Teleports all skeletons to Crypt\n    \n    \240\159\142\175 <b>Set target:</b> Mark an enemy as target. All Skeletons will prioritize the marked enemy\n    \n- Added Skeleton Archers\n    - Crypt can not swap the skeleton type with necromancer\226\128\153s staff\n    - Skeleton Archers do not move. They will search for enemy in range and attack them with bow.\n\n\240\159\145\129\239\184\143 <b>Player Location Reveal Mechanic</b>\nA new system to discourage hiding in late-game situations\n- In <b>Classic BedWars</b> and <b>Lucky Block</b>, teams are highlighted <b>60s after their bed is destroyed</b>\n- In <b>SkyWars</b>, all players are highlight when <b>20% or fewer players remain</b>\n\n\240\159\143\134 <b>Ranked Season Postponed</b>\nThe end of Ranked Season 15 has been postponed to next week(May 8, 2026 12:00 AM) to make up for the matchmaking issues over this past weekend. We sincerely apologize for the delay and inconvenience, as we were waiting on a third-party service we rely on for matchmaking to implement a fix. \nRanked Season 16 will begin with next week\226\128\153s update\n<b>Rank Decay</b>\nDue to the extension, rank decay will not increase after May 1, 2026, 3 PM PDT. So if you\226\128\153ve played within the past week, you won\226\128\153t receive any decay.\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n- \240\159\167\138\194\160<b>Freiya</b>\n- \240\159\143\185\194\160<b>Vanessa</b>\n- \240\159\140\138\194\160<b>Marina</b>\n- \240\159\148\171\194\160<b>Zarrah</b>\194\160(Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Taliyah eggs can now be mined and destroyed by any players except teammates\n- Taliyah eggs can now be mined by owner players and are refunded the egg\n- Gunpowder Barrels explode when mining\n- Added loading spinner to kit previews\n- Sophia kit is now rentable\n- Zarrah, Marrow, Arachne kit Robux price decreased: 479 \226\134\146 399\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed and polished kit previews\n- Fixed kit stats not being properly tracked on certain kits\n- Fixed various inconsistent issues with status effects not clearing up or applying\n- Fixed visual effects not applying to weapon and tool skins\n- Disabled Dodos spawning in Bridge Battles\n- Fixed Tinker execute sound constantly playing\n- Fixed Tesla Trap lightning visuals not matching with the attack range\n- Fixed Tesla Trap not doing damage when owner player is eliminated\n- Fixed Tesla Trap team color indicator\n- Fixed unusable 2 save slots for custom games (max of total 5 save slots)\n- Fixed opening honor UI changing order of teams in tablist\n- Fixed tablist not refreshing on updates\n- Fixed tablist incorrect eliminations\n- Fixed Vulcan projectiles disappearing and not dealing damage at certain angles\n- Fixed ravens applying forest enchant\n- Fixed invincible Taliyah eggs\n- Fixed various animation bugs\n- Fixed mobile ignoring attack-blocked abilities\n- Fixed diamond chestplate offset to be more centered\n- Fixed Emerald & Nightmare Victorious Grim Reaper skin soul beam colors\n- Fixed Victorious Zeno skin staff VFX colors",
