            ["title"] = "Kit Reworks + \226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes",
            ["date"] = "04/24/2026",
            ["body"] = "\240\159\148\131 <b>Kit Reworks</b>\n\240\159\167\170 <b>Alchemist</b>\n- Purchase Alchemist Flasks instead of Cauldrons\n- A recipe list UI will come up while holding a Flask\n- Each ingredient will have an ability button. Press these in the correct combinations to quickly craft potions anywhere\n- You can pick up ingredients just by walking over them\n\n\240\159\164\150 <b>Vulcan</b>\n- Interact with placed turrets to quickly pick them up into your inventory\n- While holding the tablet you will now have two abilities instead of automatically going to the remote view\n- One ability will trigger the old remote view\n- The Artillery Mark ability will focus fire of up to 3 nearby turrets on the enemy in your targeting reticle\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Zarrah</b>\n- Grounded (Gloops): No longer disables Fire ability. Now only prevents the recoil movement.\n- Improved detection to reduce gun recoil when Zarrah is touching the ground\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Infernal Shielder</b>\n- Increased range of ally damage reduction buff: 5 \226\134\146 6.5 blocks\n\240\159\159\161 Silas\n- Max stacks 10 \226\134\146 20\n- Damage reduction per stack: 2.5% \226\134\146 1%\n- Max damage reduction: 25% \226\134\146 17.5%\n- Stacks lost on death: 70% \226\134\146 30%\n- Ability - Press the Attack:\n    - No longer consumes any triumph.\n    - Shield now applies to all nearby allies\n    - Damage aura buff now applies to all nearby allies\n    - Heal aura buff now applies to all nearby allies\n    - Removed receiving double stacks duration ability duration\n    - Cooldown: 20 \226\134\146 18s\n\240\159\159\161 <b>Eldric</b>\n- Assist kills and certain mobs now give a full stack\n- Increased max stacks: 20 \226\134\146 30\n- Ally damage buff: 30% \226\134\146 25%\n- Final damage buff: 20% \226\134\146 15%\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Ignis</b>\n- Disabled breaking blocks & placing blocks while on the spirit bridge\n- Reduced vertical knockback reduction while on the spirit bridge\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Umbra</b>\n- Reduced movement speed buff: 1.3x \226\134\146 1.2x\n- Max shield from Umbra teleports reduced: 40 \226\134\146 30\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Styx</b>\n- Portal block health now scales from 30 \226\134\146 90 over the match duration\n    - This scaling speeds up for modes with faster team gen speeds\n\n<b>\226\156\168 New Armor Trim Effect</b>\nAdded a permanent Black Flame Armor Trim Effect bid for the Fire Armor Trim in the Clan Individual Auctions\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\141\172 Lucia\n\240\159\144\166\226\128\141\226\172\155 Raven\n\240\159\166\150 Dino Tamer Dom\n\240\159\144\137 Kaliyah (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Updated player-level matchmaking in Classic & Lucky Block queues to create fairer matches for newer players\n- Updated region-based matchmaking for certain queues to reduce queue times for regions with low player counts\n- Now displays who cancels the queue\n- Increased map save slots from 3 \226\134\146 5\n<b>Armor Trim Changes</b>\n- Added configurable RGB and Hex values in the color picker\n- Added a selection and preview screen for different Armor Trim Effects (you can equip different effects for armor trims that have multiple effect variants)\n- Polished UI for visual clarity\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fix Whisper owl damage not being tracked\n- Ignis no longer gets combat buffs while not on the spirit bridge\n",
