            ["title"] = "\240\159\169\187 NEW KIT - ZOLA",
            ["date"] = "04/17/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\226\152\160\239\184\143 Zola (NEW KIT)</b>\nWith the ability to meddle in the world of souls, Zola can use their <b>Soul Link</b> ability to connect enemies! Damage dealt to linked enemies incurs bonus damage to any other linked enemies. Allies can also be linked, allowing Zola to take damage in their place.\n\n<b>\240\159\148\147 Unlockable through the Battle Pass!</b>\n- FREE at Level <b>41</b>\n- Or EARLY unlock at Level <b>20</b> for players that own the battle pass\n\226\157\151The kit will be unlockable in the store after the Battle Pass is gone\n\n\240\159\155\161\239\184\143 <b>Armor Trim UI Revamp + Color Picker</b>\nArmor Trims can now be recolored to your liking to any color rather than a select palette of colors\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\144\159 Axolotl Amy\n\240\159\148\165 Infernal Shielder\n\240\159\154\145 Nyoka\n\226\154\153\239\184\143 Hephaestus (Player Level 20 Unlock!)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Easter Rabbit Grim Reaper has been moved from level 40 \226\134\146 41\n    - (note. You will not lose the skin if you already own it!)\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Easter Grim Reaper kit skin having the wrong custom sounds\n- Fixed players not receiving the Easter Bunny Bed Skin reward in the Battle Pass",
