            ["updateLogId"] = 244,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes + Map Update",
            ["date"] = "04/10/2026",
            ["body"] = "A new balance update is live along with a ton of map changes!\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n\n<b>\240\159\148\131 Rework - Crocowolf</b>\n- Build Bloodlust gauge by being near damage dealt (damage to you, teammates, enemies, etc.)\n- Slightly more Bloodlust from non-player entities\n- When the Bloodlust gauge is full use your ability to transform into Beast Form\n- Can cancel Beast Form early to maintain some Bloodlust\n- Get full Bloodlust when your bed is broken\n\n<b>\240\159\148\131 Rework - Cobalt</b>\n- While in Overload you will reflect 25% of all melee damage dealt to you back to the attacker\n- No longer gives a damage buff\n- Still has speed boost\n- Duration increased: 6s \226\134\146 8s\n\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Kaliyah</b>\n- Increased stack duration: 8 seconds \226\134\146 12\n- Decreased punch cooldown: 10 seconds \226\134\146 8\n\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Yuzi</b>\n- Progress regen time delay: 8 seconds \226\134\146 6 seconds\n\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Aery</b>\n- Projectile stack damage ratio: 0.5 \226\134\146 0.8\n\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Sheila</b>\n- More stack reduction on death: 40 + stacks * 0.1 \226\134\146 40 + stacks * 0.15\n- Increase stacks needed for each level: 200, 600, 1200 \226\134\146 215, 625, 1240\n\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Whisper</b>\n- Projectile damage now scales with equipped sword:\n    - Wood: 5\n    - Stone: 7\n    - Iron: 10\n    - Diamond: 14\n    - Emerald: 18\n\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Void Knight</b>\n- Corrupt Tier emerald requirement: 10 \226\134\146 12\n- Chosen Tier emerald requirement: 40 \226\134\146 48\n\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Adetunde</b>\n- Shield max cap set to 50\n\n\240\159\143\166 <b>Clan Auction Changes</b>\nPodiums are now active in lobbies, and will display the top-performing clans in each lobby. The first customizable podium banner is available in this week\226\128\153s Clan Auction. We\226\128\153ve also updated all the auction items for this week\226\128\153s auction (and increased the expiration time to 14 days for this week\226\128\153s rental items), so make sure to check them out!\n\n\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 <b>Map Changes & Updates</b>\n- Volatile (Squads)\n- Tranquil Meadow (Squads)\n- Candyland (Squads)\n- Desert Storm (Squads)\n- Airship (Squads)\n- Crystalmount (Squads)\n- Desert Oasis (Squads, Doubles)\n- Crypt (Squads)\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\164\150 <b>Cogsworth</b>\n\240\159\171\149 <b>Alchemist</b>\n\240\159\143\180\226\128\141\226\152\160\239\184\143 <b>Davey</b>\n\240\159\143\185 <b>Bekzat</b> (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Generator timer not visible in some map\n- Fixed not able to purchase sword after reconnect\n- Fixed Projectile damage not accounting armor in match stats\n\n",
