            ["updateLogId"] = 243,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\240\159\165\154 Egg Hunt 2026",
            ["date"] = "04/3/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\240\159\165\154 Egg Hunt 2026</b>\nOur annual Egg Hunt has returned! Can you track down all 18 eggs? \n8 are hidden, so team up and uncover their secrets to earn rewards. Good luck!\n\n<b>\240\159\142\129 Egg Hunt Milestones</b>\n- <b>3 Eggs</b> \226\128\148 Egg Hunt 2026 Title\n- <b>8 Eggs</b> \226\128\148 Lucky Crate + 1.5x BattlePass XP Boost\n- <b>12 Eggs</b> \226\128\148 Image Emote + 2x BattlePass XP Boost\n- <b>16 Eggs</b> \226\128\148 Roblox Badge + Diamond Lucky Crate\n- <b>18 Eggs</b> \226\128\148 Eggceptional Title\n\n<b>\240\159\144\176 Easter BattlePass</b>\nThe Easter BattlePass is here! Progress through 40 levels of rewards by playing matches and completing battlepass missions, unlocking limited-time rewards along the way!\n\n\240\159\147\140 <b>Note!!.</b> Easter Grim Reaper Kit Skin & Pixel Sword Skins will not be exclusive to the battlepass and may return in the future\n<b>Notable Rewards</b>\n\240\159\170\153 22,000 Bed Coins\n\240\159\155\141\239\184\143 2 Kit Skin Crates\n\240\159\144\176 Easter Grim Reaper Kit Skin\n\226\154\148\239\184\143 Pixel Sword Skin set\n\240\159\146\128 5 Kill Effects\n\240\159\155\143\239\184\143 3 Bed Break Effects\n\240\159\155\143\239\184\143 1 Bed Skin\n- and much more!\n\n<b>\240\159\143\176 Clan Auctions</b>\nGet ready to bid in the all new <b>Clan Auctions</b> system. Bid on exclusive items in a weekly rotating shop with new rewards! Clan admins can bid on items with Clan War Crystals and clan members can bid with their Clan Contribution Coins. Just head over to the <b>Clans</b> menu and check out the new <b>Auctions</b> tab to start bidding.\n\n<b>\240\159\142\129 New Clan Exclusive Rewards</b> (Clan War Coins)\n- Clan Tag Colors - Show off your clan in style with unique clan chat tag colors (expires after 7 days)\n- Podium Banners - Get clan banners for your clan\226\128\153s lobby podium, to represent your clan if you are one of the top clans in your lobby\n\n<b>\240\159\142\129 New Clan-Member Exclusive Rewards</b> (Clan Contribution Coins)\n- Kit Skins - Rent kit skins for your favorite kits. This week\226\128\153s kit skins are available for the first time since they launched! (expires after 7 days)\n    - <b>Including:</b> Hexed Yuzi, Space Miner, Prismatic Marina, Ghost Hannah\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\143\185 Archer\n\240\159\146\128 Crypt\n\240\159\144\186 Skoll\n\240\159\144\137 Lian (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Enabled Arrows to be dropped & shared\n- Resolved issues with beds showing up as players and players becoming beds\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Farmer Cletus not being able to harvest other crops if at max Pumpkins in inventory\n- Fixed Arachne spiders not giving kill credit to the owner\n- Fixed Keep Inventory custom match setting\n",
