        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 241,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes + Map Update",
            ["date"] = "03/27/2026",
            ["body"] = "A new balance update is live along with a ton of map changes!\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n<b>Kits</b>\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Krystal</b> \n- Reduce amount of momentum lost on taking damage\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Sheila</b>\n- Minimum death penalty stack loss: 75 \226\134\146 40 + 0.1(current stacks)\n- Lowered level 3 stack threshold from 1500 \226\134\146 1200\n- Base seahorse damage 2 \226\134\146 3\n- Don\226\128\153t lose stacks past the last upgraded seahorse level\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Vanessa</b> \n- Slightly increased projectile knockback multiplier\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Raven</b> \n- Lowered poison damage per tick (8 \226\134\146 5), increased tickrate (0.75s \226\134\146 0.5s)\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Abbadon</b>\n- Scarab health now only starts decreasing once the spawner disappears or moves out of range\n\240\159\159\161 <b>Grim Reaper</b>\n- Slower movespeed but longer invincibility when consuming soul\n\240\159\159\161 <b>Cogsworth</b>\n- Reduce overclock gather bot damage per tick: 7 \226\134\146 4\n- Gatherbot damage applies knockback\n- Gatherbot movement speed increased: 1.75x \226\134\146 1.85x\n\240\159\159\161 <b>Elektra</b>\n- Elektra can no longer attack while dashing\n- Elektra dash exit duration increased: 0.2s \226\134\146 0.3s\n- Elektra dash damage: 8 \226\134\146 15\n- When killing a player with static debuff applied from dash, refund 1 dash\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Nahla</b>\n- Oasis Heal Veil Ability: Reduced effectiveness on self by 20%\n- Reduced max damage buff from 30% \226\134\146 20%\n- Vessel fire cooldown: 0.35s \226\134\146 0.5s\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Fortuna</b>\n- No longer able to combat while drawing cards\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Nyoka</b>\n- On using Charge Staff ability, you lose a base flat amount of progress\n<b>Enchants</b>\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Forest</b> \n- Reduced max health gain in half for ranged weapons\n<b>Others</b>\n- Max Teslas reduced 2 \226\134\146 1\n- Bhaa\n    - Can only spawn before 18 minutes\n    - Bhaa buff duration reduced: 5 \226\134\146 2.5min\n\n<b>\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 Map Changes</b>\n<b>Updates & Returning old maps</b>\n- Blossom (SW)\n- Catacombs (Doubles)\n- Oriental (Doubles)\n- Sanctum (Doubles)\n- Shadowfall (Doubles)\n- Darkholm (Squads)\n- Crypt (Squads)\n- Grotto (Squads)\n- Western (Squads)\n- Winter Forest (Squads)\n<b>New maps</b>\n- Citadel Towers (Squads)\n- Elder Woods (Squads)\n- Grandpeak (Squads)\n- Vineyard (Doubles, Squads)\n- Sand Shrine (Squads)\n- Volatile V2 (Squads)\n- Oriental (Duels)\n- Bayo (Doubles, Squads)\n<b>Removed</b>\n- Christmas & Winter themed maps\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\226\155\147\239\184\143 Warden\n\226\155\143\239\184\143 Miner\n\226\155\179 Silas\n\226\154\148\239\184\143 Yuzi (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Capped player terminal fall speed. Players no longer infinitely accelerate when falling.\n- Telepearls, Elektra, and other characters with teleport or dash abilities/items resets player falling velocity\n<b>Snow Weather Changes</b>\n- Improved winter weather event lag\n- Snow piles only spawn on full blocks\n- Snow piles break if there is no supporting block\n<b>Team Upgrades</b>\nAdded back Destruction Team Upgrade\n- Tier 1: 25% block destruction | 3 diamonds\n- Tier 2: 50% block destruction | 6 diamonds\n- Tier 3: 75% block destruction | 15 diamonds\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Umeko chakram line of sight\n- Fixed arena invincibility bug\n- Optimized Fortuna card auto-targeting causing fps drop\n- Fix nametag level not yet replicated\n- Fix Isabel shield not de-equipping after swapping off sword\n- Fix Mass Hammer damage causing all player-sourced damage to deal 35 damage\n- Fixed certain projectiles not accounting for ranged legend achievements\n- Fixed axolotls disappearing for Axolotl Amy\n- Fixed telepearls not working at high fall speeds",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://100945847549614",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
