        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 240,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Hyper Kits LTM + Achivements Update",
            ["date"] = "03/20/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\240\159\146\170 Hyper Kits LTM</b>\nLooking for fast-paced chaos? In this mode everything is faster, stronger, more chaotic, and probably unbalanced. Cooldowns are lower, prices are discounted, generators are faster, movement speed is increased\226\128\166there are too many changes to list here, so jump in and find out for yourself!\n\n<b>\240\159\142\150\239\184\143 Achievements + Rewards</b>\n15 new achievements have been added! In addition, many achievements now have rewards.\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\131\143 Fortuna\n\240\159\165\183 Umeko\n\240\159\144\157 Flora\n\226\173\144 Star Collector Stella (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n<b>\240\159\142\174 Playlist</b>\n- Removed One In The Chamber\n- Added Arena Doubles back into rotation\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- New custom match toggle: <b>Toggle Emote Effects</b>\n- New custom match toggle: <b>Hide Nametag for Host Only</b>\n- New custom match command /shownametag (player) . @ selectors are supported (Ex. /shownametag @t:(teamname))\n- New custom match command /hidenametag (player)\n- Added UGC section to the Store\n- You can now preview Kit Skins from the store or kit details page\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Wren\226\128\153s Shop not spawning correctly and not updating items\n- Fixed Nahla Orbs occasionally not being deleted\n- Fixed Sheila Seahorse so it no longer downgrades below a level\n- Fixed Fury Potion not buffing attack speed\n- Fixed Camera Shift Lock for PC (Left-Ctrl or Right-Ctrl)\n- Fixed Bekzat Falcon health bar <b>disappearing on</b> player death\n- Fixed an issue where the Krystal Freeze ability would activate when using the Spin ability\n- Fixed Generators starting before match start in Ranked mode\n- Console: Now returns back to shift-lock mode after closing a GUI",
