        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 239,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Balance Update + BP & Event Extentded",
            ["date"] = "03/13/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\240\159\148\165 Battle Pass 2x XP Weekend \240\159\148\165</b>\n\n<b>\240\159\142\171 Battle Pass & Event Extended</b>\nThe Battle Pass & Event has been extended through the end of the weekend! To help with the last minute grind, enjoy an XP boost weekend \240\159\148\165\n\n\226\154\150\239\184\143 <b>Balance Changes</b>\n<b>Kits</b>\n\240\159\159\162 Eldertree\n- Slightly increased the number of orbs that spawn at the start of a match\n\240\159\159\162 Agni\n- Decreased time to get a new cluster bomb: 40s \226\134\146 35s\n\240\159\159\162 Melody\n- self healing ratio: 85%\226\134\14690%\n\240\159\148\180 Noelle\n- Decreased Frosty Slime\226\128\153s maximum slow amount: 35% \226\134\146 30%\n- Increased time between Blessed Slime healing: 2s \226\134\146 2.5s\n\240\159\148\180 Lani\n- Healing effect reduced by 50% if target was recently affected by Lani\n\240\159\148\180 Bee Keeper\n- Emerald and diamond drop rate reduced on lower level bee hive\n\240\159\148\180 Farmer Cletus\n- Can only carry up to 8 Pumpkin bombs\n- Pumpkin Bomb is now a non-sharable item\n\240\159\148\180 Warden\n- Only drops soul if at least one Warden contributed to the kill\n\240\159\148\180 Nyx\n- Reduced max armor penetration during midnight: 80% \226\134\146 75%\n- Reduced armor penetration scaling per attack during midnight: 20% \226\134\146 15%\n- After using the midnight ability, there\226\128\153s a 15s cooldown before damage counts towards re-activating the ability\n- Increased midnight duration: 10s \226\134\146 12s\n\240\159\148\180 Hephaestus\n- Shield reduced for void and emerald mechs:\n    - Emerald Mech Health: 430\226\134\146410\n    - Void Mech Health: 630\226\134\146600\n- Self Repair cooldown increased: 5\226\134\1466\n<b>Team Upgrades</b>\n\240\159\159\162 Diamond Generator Upgrades\n- Diamonds drop faster for each upgrade tier: 66.6s/53.3s/44.4s \226\134\146 50s/38s/25s\n- Costs reduced for each upgrade tier: 4/8/12 \226\134\146 3/6/10\n<b>Items</b>\n\240\159\148\180 Witch\226\128\153s Broom\n- Max Health reduced: 300\226\134\146100\n<b>Ranked RP</b>\nPlayers competing in Bronze through Gold ranked tiers gain more RP and lose less.\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\142\184 Melody\n\240\159\165\184 Milo\n\240\159\170\153 Wren\n\240\159\148\171 Zarrah (Player Level 20 Unlock) (First Time Free!)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Added `Hold to Auto Swing` setting under Mobile tab to toggle the new sword button auto-swing feature\n- Stricter skill-based matchmaking for Nightmare+ players\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Kit Skins features missing when `Use Kit Skin Model` was disabled\n- Fixed Sophia Kit displaying the wrong keybind. (Changed from `R` -> `Z`)\n- Fixed Pumpkin Void Knight kit skin sometimes kicking players from matches\n- Fixed Kit Augments getting removed on respawn in Arena LTM\n- Fixed an issue where some Kit Items could appear in Wren\226\128\153s Shop\n- Fixed anti-cheating on respawn after the desert map event",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://121071902828280",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
        },
        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 238,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Void Knight Kit Contract + \240\159\167\172LTM Update",
            ["date"] = "03/06/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\240\159\170\150 Armor Trim</b>\nWhen unlocking a new armor trim, instead of getting a fully random armor trim, you now select from one of the following armor trim categories, to get a randomized armor trim from just that category:\n\n\240\159\166\135<b>Halloween</b>: Bat, Claws, or Crystal\nThe first armor trim unlocked on a kit can only come from the Beginner category, but after progressing your first armor trim, you can choose from any of the categories. As a result of these changes, the Frosty armor trim is no longer unobtainable. All players who already own the Frosty armor trim can find Armor Trim XP Boosts in your locker.\n\n<b>\240\159\142\174 Controller Update</b>\n- Controllers can now hold Right Trigger to continuously attack with a sword.\n- Added controller auto-selection support to more UI menus\n- New controller key binds\n    - <b>Toggle Shift Lock (DPad Up):</b> Toggle shift lock on/off.\n    - <b>Toggle Virtual Mouse (DPad Down):</b> Toggle a virtual mouse to freely select UI.\n\n<b>\240\159\147\177 Mobile Sword Button</b>\n- Can now hold down the sword button to continuously attack with a sword\n- Changed to support dragging while holding down the button so you can aim and attack at the same time\n\n<b>\240\159\167\172 Kit Fusion LTM</b>\n<b>Balance Changes (Kit Fusion only, will not affect other modes)</b>\n- Aery damage buff decreased\n- Eldertree max health buff decreased\n- Zephyr wind attack damage decreased\n- Eldertree / Void Knight - When using this specific combo Void Knight\226\128\153s armor defense is reduced. This also stacks with Eldertree\226\128\153s max health nerf\n<b>Fixes</b>\n- Styx / Marrow - Death will put you in Marrow\226\128\153s revive state, if you die in this state before reviving you will be put into Styx\226\128\153s ghost mode\n- Isabel - Fixed an issue where some swords (i.e. Rageblade) had a bug that would make the sword unusable\n- Vanessa / Archer - Fixed an issue where Vanessa could triple shot with Archer\226\128\153s tactical bows without charging\n- Fixed an issue where picking both slots are None / Random would give you the same quit twice\n- Fixed an issue where some items\226\128\153 (i.e. Zeno\226\128\153s staff) keybinds would not work if you had abilities from a second kit\n\n<b>\226\154\148\239\184\143 Arena LTM</b>\nAdded 10 new augments to the Arena Gamemode!\n(1 Silver, 4 Golds, and 5 Prismatics augments)\n<b>Changes:</b>\n- 5 new Arena modules\n- Optimized module loading\n- More prominent shop button\n- \226\128\156Purchase\226\128\157 button immediately after round end\n- Blocks are 1-hit\n- Rebalanced and reworked a few relics\n<b>Arena Bug Fixes:</b>\n- Team Health color not updating correctly on the UI\n- Fixed falling into void after winning round removing gold (teleports you back to spectator area)\n- Fixed leaving pre-match start causing issues\n- Fixed speed stat relic making player super fast\n- Other miscellaneous bug fixes\n\n <b>\240\159\159\170 Void Knight Kit Contract</b>\nAdded a new kit contract for Void Knight!\n<b>Notable Rewards</b>\n- Tier 6 reward: Void Knight Devour Emote\n- Tier 8 reward: Voidify Kill Effect\n- Tier 9 reward: Void Creatures Bed break Effect\n- Tier 10 reward: Void Knight Amor Lobby Gadget\n\n<b>\240\159\149\185\239\184\143 Playlist Queues</b>\nChanged queues to rotate every 2 hours\n\226\158\149 Added: One in The Chamber\n\226\158\150 Moved: PVP Arena Doubles (Now permanent for a limited time)\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\142\163 Fisherman\n\240\159\146\168 Smoke\n\240\159\140\178 Elder Tree\n\240\159\140\153 Nyx (Level 20 unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- You can now right-click to quickly equip a kit from the kits menu (PC)\n- Better Team Upgrade UI scaling\n- Improved Ranked Queue matchmaking for high RP nightmare players\n- Zeno\226\128\153s keybinds for the Wizard Staff have been changed to item keys instead of ability keys\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed not able to change kit during Rank Draft\n- Fixed elder tree not taking vertical knockback\n- Cancelled match now shows Cancelled instead of Defeat\n- Fixed Martin\226\128\153s sword animation not being played correctly\n- Fixed Streamer Mode setting not saving\n\n\240\159\151\168\239\184\143 <b>Comments</b>\n- Milestones revamp has been postponed while we work on new changes",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://121071902828280",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
        },
        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 237,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes + \240\159\148\165 2x BP XP Weekend",
            ["date"] = "02/27/2026",
            ["body"] = "A new balance update is live!\n\n\240\159\148\165 2x Battle Pass XP Weekend \240\159\148\165\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n<b>Kits</b>\n\240\159\159\162 Crocowolf\n- Increased beast duration: 6 mins \226\134\146 7 mins\n\240\159\159\162 Styx\n- Increased portal HP: 30 \226\134\146 100\n- Small speed boost after exiting portal\n\240\159\159\161 Marrow\n- Decrease player health on respawn 75 \226\134\146 50\n- Less slow from poison 0.7x move speed \226\134\146 0.75x\n- Faster when in head form 0.8x move speed \226\134\146 0.85x\n\240\159\159\161 Farmer Cletus\n- Pumpkin Seed cost 100 iron \226\134\146 60\n- Melon Seeds now cost +1 emerald for every 5 purchased within the last minute (prices decrease back down after the minute)\n\240\159\148\180 Zephyr\n- Decreased max orb assist time: 5s \226\134\146 3s\n\240\159\148\180 Taliyah\n- Slightly decreased iron + emerald scaling\n\240\159\148\180 Trixie\n- Increased warp ability cooldown: 13s \226\134\146 20s\n- Decreased cooldown per hit: 1.4s \226\134\146 3s\n\240\159\148\180 Nyoka\n- Reduced Mending Canopy Staff self healing multiplier: 0.33x \226\134\146 0.25x\n\240\159\148\180 Fisherman\n- Chances of getting jackpot and emerald fish now scale dynamically based on how lucky you are rather than a static value. Overall this will be a decrease in the chance of getting these rare fish\n\240\159\148\180 Grove\n- Crystalheart flowers now cost double the water of Soulvine and Tearbloom flowers\n- Crystalheart crops are now flammable\n\240\159\148\180 Fire spreads to crop blocks (Farmer Cletus, Taliyah, Spirit Grove)\n<b>Blocks</b>\n\240\159\159\162 Max Tesla Trap Cap increased from 1\226\134\1462\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\148\165 Agni\n\240\159\145\187 Ignis\n\240\159\143\185 Bounty Hunter\n\240\159\142\169 Umbra\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Updated Kit Shop UI\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed an issue where spectators and enemies could harvest Farmer Cletus\226\128\153 crops\n- Fixed issues with spectating friends\n- Fixed Honor UI not displaying properly for large teams\n- Fixed an issue where spectators could give honor\n- Fixed LNY items not displaying properly in shop\n- Fixed an underlying issue with sword knockback",
