        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 236,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "New Player Update + Rare Envelopes",
            ["date"] = "02/20/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\240\159\165\189 New Player Experience</b>\nWe\226\128\153re releasing new additions to help with the new player experience.\n- \226\128\156Recommended\226\128\157 category in shop to help choose what items to buy\n- In-game tips can now appear\n    - Auto disabled after level 15\n- Both can be toggled in settings\n\n<b>\240\159\144\142 LNY Envelopes</b>\n- Tier 1: Removed the purchase limit\nWe\226\128\153ve added two higher tiers of LNY envelopes to the event shop. They have larger Bedcoin rewards and higher BattlePass XP, as well as additional rewards.\n- Tier 2: Chance of obtaining Armor Trim XP Boost Tickets & Battle Pass XP Boost Tickets.\n- Tier 3: Chance of obtaining Kit Skin Crate Fragments. And guaranteed boost tickets.\n\n<b>\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 New Maps</b>\n\240\159\167\170 Fusion Doubles\n\240\159\140\177 Tranquil Meadow Doubles\n\240\159\140\177 Tranquil Meadow Squads\n\240\159\170\153 Gold Rush Squads\n\240\159\140\138 Stream Valley Squads\n\226\157\132\239\184\143 Winter Forest Squads\n\n<b>\240\159\143\151\239\184\143 Map Fixes</b>\n\240\159\148\177 Atlantic Ruins Squads\n\240\159\141\130 Autumn Duels\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\144\157  Bee Keeper Beatrix\n\240\159\148\165 Ember\n\240\159\140\177 Noelle\n\240\159\166\181 Terra (Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\142\138 <b>Content Creator Milestone</b>\nCongratulations to <b>Slaze</b> for recently hitting 30,000 subscribers! To celebrate, he will be hosting a 12-hour livestream this Saturday at 11 AM EST, featuring multiple kit giveaways.\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Added 1 more kit skin fragment to the Battle Pass (now adds up to 10)\n- Added kit\226\128\153s base health stat to kit info UI\n- Lobby Statboard now shows honor\n- Updated Honor UI\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed honor UI being stuck on screen\n- Fixed honoring players that have already disconnected from match\n- Fixed not being able to build up while standing still with certain kit skins\n- Fixed free kits (Marcel, Ragnar, Isabelle) kit skins not saving skin selections\n- Fixed Christmas Carol emote globally pausing music\n- Fixed Hephaestus first person shiftlock camera offset\n- Fixed Roblox Shift Lock Switch setting not being respected (Enable \"ShiftLock Switch\" Roblox setting to toggle shiftlock on PC)\n- Fix crosshair state inconsistencies while swapping from first to third person and shiftlock\n- Fix Kaida being able to swing while frozen\n- Fixed infinite tesla glitch with Wren shop\n- Fix setting kit skin accessory visuals not applying initially on match start when switching kit skins",
