            ["updateLogId"] = 235,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Valentine + LNY Event",
            ["date"] = "02/13/2026",
            ["body"] = "\240\159\167\167  <b>LNY Event</b>\nGet currency for using the new Honor system (described below) and use that currency to buy envelopes in the event shop. When you open an envelope you will get prizes like event battle pass XP and Bed Coins!\n\n\226\173\144 <b>Honor System</b>\nSpread the love with honor and receive fortune in return! Give honor to teammates and opponents at the end of a match or when you are eliminated. You will get a small amount of XP just for giving or receiving Honor! You can give one point to a teammate, and one to an opponent. You can also see honor points in players\226\128\153 profiles.\n\n\240\159\146\152 <b>Valentine + LNY Battle Pass</b>\nA new event battle pass is active with exciting rewards themed around Valentines and Lunar New Year! Progress through all 30 levels to unlock them all!\n<b>Notable Rewards</b>\n- Dynasty Barbarian kit skin\n- Heartseeker Sword, Pickaxe, and Axe Skin\n- Heartbeam Sword skin\n- 20,000+ Bed Coins\n- Lucky Crates, Skin Crates, Kill Effects, Bed Break Effects, and more!\n\n\240\159\164\175 <b>Item Skins</b>\nWe\226\128\153re introducing skins for base items! This includes swords, pickaxes, axes, bows, and crossbows. You can receive your first item skins in the new battle pass.\n<b>New Item Skin Lines</b>\n- Darkheart\n- Heartseeker\n- Heartbeam (Available in Battle Pass)\n\n<b>\240\159\145\149 New Kit Skins</b>\nWe\226\128\153ve released 3 new amazing kit skins this update\n1. Dynasty Barbarian (Available in Battle Pass)\n2. Heartseeker Aery (Store)\n3. Darkheart Evelynn (Available in Battle Pass)\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Bounty Hunter</b>\n- Assists payout 50% of bounty rewards (rounded values)\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Xu\226\128\153rot</b>\n- Reduced dragon breath cooldown: 2s \226\134\146 1s\n- Reduced dragon breath armor penetration: 40% \226\134\146 30%\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Void Knight</b>\n- Void Knight no longer takes reduced fall damage\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Grove</b>\n- Crystalheart flowers now cost double the water of Soulvine and Tearbloom flowers\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Conqueror</b>\n- Damage, Heal, and Defense Banners now have a maximum stack size of 3\n- Reduced healing on Heal Banner: 17.5% per tick \226\134\146 13% per tick\n\n\240\159\167\184 <b>Limited Time Items</b>\nDuring the LNY event, the dragon mortar and firecrackers have a chance of showing up as Limited Time Items!\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\164\150 Cyber\n\240\159\140\138 Marina\n\240\159\141\172 Lucia\n\240\159\140\153 Nyx (Player Level 20 Unlock!)\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Grove crops can no longer be watered when Grove doesn\226\128\153t have enough energy\n- Xu\226\128\153rot\226\128\153s dragon breath no longer gives energy instead of draining it\n- Fixed kit fusion kit selection not properly applying in game\n\n",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://121071902828280",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
