        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 234,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Valentine + LNY Update Next Week",
            ["date"] = "02/06/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\226\143\176 Content Update Delay</b>\nUnfortunately, this content update will be delayed by a week. We\226\128\153re really sorry for the wait and appreciate your patience. \nOur Valentine\226\128\153s and LNY update will now release next week, alongside a new battle pass with exciting new reward types!\n\n<b>\240\159\144\167 Penguin Weekend Event</b>\nThe Penguin Weekend Event is back! Baby penguins are roaming the lobby! Catch them with the web launcher and bring them back to Taliyah in the Lobby for a reward!\nThe event happens once every two hours, first starting at 4pm PST, and ending 4pm PST on Monday.\n\n<b>\240\159\146\142 Hyper Gen</b> \nTier 4 Team Upgrades are back! Purchase Tier 4 upgrades with 500 diamonds for 9999% diamonds, 9999% destruction, 9999% damage, or 9999% armor\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\143\185 Vanessa\n\240\159\166\150 Dino Tamer Dom\n\240\159\148\165 Kaliyah\n\240\159\140\177 Grove (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n<b>\240\159\142\174 LTM Rotation</b>\nNew queues in rotation\n\226\158\149 Hyper Gen (Arcade Playlist)\n\226\158\149 Bridge Duels 1v1 (PVP Playlist)\nRemoved\n\226\158\150 Block Hunt\n\226\158\150 One in the Chamber\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Slightly increased RP gained for 1st and 2nd in ranked\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Various exploit fixes\n",
