        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 233,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Update + S14 Ranked Rewards",
            ["date"] = "01/30/26",
            ["body"] = "A new balance update is live! This week comes with new Ranked features that address current issues with teaming and long match times. Along with the release of Ranked Rewards and Balance Changes!\n\n\240\159\154\171 <b>Ranked Anti-Teaming Countermeasures</b>\nThese changes apply to <b>Ranked only</b>!\n- Players that get a kill while defending their bed will now get a bounty. The bounty goes up over time and with kills. This results in teaming attempts giving a potential resource advantage to the team they\226\128\153re targeting.\n- Defending teams get a temporary buff when multiple teams attack their base simultaneously, or within a certain amount of time of each other.\n- These advantages only apply to teams that still have a bed.\n\n\240\159\151\186\239\184\143\194\160<b>Ranked Map Decay</b>\nWe\226\128\153ve noticed that ranked matches tend to last longer than the average Squads game, so we\226\128\153re reintroducing an optimized version of Map Decay to the <b>S15 Squads Ranked Queue</b> that will begin 21 minutes into a match and lasts 10 minutes.\n\n\240\159\143\134\194\160<b>Season 14 Ranked Rewards</b>\nSeason 14 Ranked Rewards are now out! Players who finished in Gold rank or higher have received the Victorious Eldertree kit skin. Higher-ranked players will get a special version of the skin that matches their rank along with the variants of the ranks below them.\n<b>Rewards</b>\n- Victorious Eldertree\n- Title of the rank you reached\n\n1\239\184\143\226\131\1634\239\184\143\226\131\163\194\160<b>Ranked Season 14</b>\n<b>Congratulations to the players who reached the top in Ranked Season 14!</b>\n\240\159\165\135Eunsu @OneAndOs\n\240\159\165\136Yoianstar @IANTHEPRIME\n\240\159\165\137nuptheprup @BOBCATBESTMETAL\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n<b>Kits</b>\n\240\159\159\161 <b>Collectible Kit Spawn Rates</b>\nSpawn rates for collectible-based kits have been adjusted to scale dynamically with map size. Larger maps will now feature higher spawn rates, while smaller maps will have reduced spawn rates to better maintain balance between games.\n<b>Affected Kits:</b>\194\160Beekeeper Beatrix, Alchemist, Eldertree, Star Collector Stella, Grove, Gompy, Metal Detector\n<b>\240\159\159\162 Cogsworth</b>\n- Bots have better pathfinding and no longer get stuck\n<b>\240\159\159\162 Nahla</b>\n- Heal per projectile at all Vessel Tiers: 2 (previously: [.5, 1, 1])\n- Holding down to heal now goes as fast as the cooldown allows\n<b>\240\159\159\162 Zarrah</b>\n- Reduced the wielders push back when firing the gun when touching the ground\n- Increased width of gun fire hitbox\n- Gun Ability Armor Penetration: 0 \226\134\146 10%\n- Bleed Status Effect Armor Penetration: 0 \226\134\146 30%\n<b>\240\159\159\162 Kaida</b>\n- Claw Attack Speed: .65 \226\134\146 .55\n<b>\240\159\159\162 Wren</b>\n- Jump/Speed Potion Duration: 20 \226\134\146 25s\n- Jump/Speed Potion Price: 90 \226\134\146 75 Iron\n- Serpents Touch Potion Price: 90 Iron \226\134\146 1 Emerald\n- Serpent Touch Potion Duration: 30 \226\134\146 35s\n- Fury Potion Price: 90 Iron \226\134\146 1 Emerald\n- Jump, Speed, Serpent, Fury potion max stack size: 3\n- Invis Potion max stack size: 1 \226\134\146 2\n<b>\240\159\148\180 Fisherman</b>\n- Slightly reduced Diamond gains\n- Slightly reduced early game Emerald gains\n<b>\240\159\148\180 Grove</b>\n- Energy loss is now based on the amount of plants being nurtured\n- Fixed ability sometimes permanently showing disabled\n- Crystal Heart gen multiplier buff per seed: 10% \226\134\146 8%\n<b>Enchants</b>\n<b>\240\159\148\180 Forest</b>\n- Health gain now diminishes after each stack\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\149\138\239\184\143\194\160Raven\n\240\159\170\153\194\160Metal Detector\n\240\159\170\178\194\160Uma\n\240\159\145\187\194\160Spirit Catcher (Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Adetunde contract goals have been made easier\n- Increased Party Size Limit: 16 \226\134\146 32\n- Increased Party Size Limit for 16v16: 12 \226\134\146 16\n- Ranked: Increased the range of possible ranks you can queue against\n- Ranked: Slightly increased RP gains\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fix miner statues missing clothing and weapons\n- Fix desert sandstorm flagging anticheat\n- Fixed Adetunde\226\128\153s kit mastery emote not showing\n- Fix pathfinding for Cogsworth\226\128\153s bots and other entities to no longer get stuck\n- Fixed \226\128\156nan\226\128\157 displaying for RP in player profiles\n- Fixed Rank being incorrectly set to bronze\n",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://116368645161554",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
