        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 232,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\240\159\143\134 Ranked Season 15",
            ["date"] = "1/23/2026",
            ["body"] = "\240\159\143\134 <b>New Ranked Season</b>\nRanked season 15 starts now! For this ranked season, we\'ve switched from the 5v5 game mode to squads (4 teams of 4).\nWe\'ll announce the top 3 players from Ranked Season 14 as part of next week\'s update.\n\n<b>Additional Changes</b>\n- The RP system has been reworked to work with squads (multiple placements instead of 1 winner and 1 loser). We may continue to make adjustments throughout the ranked season\n- As a result of the RP system changes, we\'ve removed demotion shield and rank skipping, because it\'s now easier to gain ranks\n- We\'ve updated some of the maps in the squads pool, to follow stricter guidelines for a ranked mode\n- The Drafting UI has also been changed to work for squads ranked\n- Ranked Decay - Players ranked Diamond 1+ are subjected to \"Ranked Decay\". This means that players will have a 1 week buffer to play a game before decaying and losing RP. Playing a game will reset the 1 week timer. Players that are decaying will lose 50RP every day before falling out of the decay range (up until Platinum IV 75RP). This change is mostly to force players that have a lot of RP to play games rather than just waiting until the season ends after grinding a lot of RP.\n\n<b>\240\159\142\129 Ranked Rewards</b>\nRanked rewards are planned to come out **next week**. The ranked kit skin for **Season 14** is **Victorious Eldertree**.\nPlayers who finished the season at **Gold rank or higher** will exclusively receive the **Victorious Eldertree** kit skin.\n\n\240\159\144\167 <b>New Lobby Event!</b>\nThe Baby penguins are roaming the lobby! Catch them with the web launcher and bring them back to Taliyah for reward!\nThe event happens once every two hours, first one happens at 4:00 pm PST and last one happens mid night on Sunday night.\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\148\168 Builder\n\240\159\146\142 Drill\n\240\159\145\188 Trinity\n\240\159\170\147 Void Regent (Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Add sprint to tutorial\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed One in The Chamber kills not reflecting kill count\n- Fixed Lucky Block items sometimes giving too many of same items\n- Fixed not being able to place alchemist cauldrons once destroyed by enemy\n- Fixed Alchemist potion brewing timer being slightly off\n- Fixed Umbra peek state-locked after taking damage\n- Fixed teammate interactions stopping recall\n- Fixed new player bundle showing up in game servers\n",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://93116949175834",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
        },
        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 231,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes Week",
            ["date"] = "1/16/2026",
            ["body"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 <b>Balance Changes</b>\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Warrior</b>\n- Warrior Armor gives extra 5% damage reduction against swords and projectiles\n- Emerald Armor (equipped on Warrior) gives extra 10% damage reduction against swords and projectiles\n- Emerald Armor (equipped on Warrior) gives extra 10% damage reduction against swords and projectiles\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Melody</b>\n- Healing amount: 11 per second \226\134\146 13\n- Healing range: 15 blocks \226\134\146 17\n- Self heal multiplier: 80% \226\134\146 85%\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Marcel</b>\n- Now Gets discount on Tesla Coils: 65 Iron \226\134\14650 Iron\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Beekeeper Beatrix</b>\n- Decreased bee spawn interval\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Caitlyn</b>\n- Vulnerable damage: 12% \226\134\146 10%\n- Decay initial duration: 3s \226\134\146 2s\n- Active target damage boost: 30% \226\134\146 25%\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Eldertree</b>\n- Initial orb spawns: 5 \226\134\146 4\n- Max health per orb decreased\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Triton</b>\n- Trident damage 28\226\134\14623\n\n\240\159\143\134 <b>Season 14 Ranked Extension</b>\n- Season 14 Ranked will be extended by 1 week due to unforeseen queuing and matchmaking issues. Season 15 will still start next week on January 23rd!\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\155\176\239\184\143 Zenith\n\240\159\148\177 Ares\n\240\159\145\188 Lani\n\240\159\166\144 Sheila (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\142\137 <b>Content Creator Parkour Event</b>\nSlaze is hosting a parkour event, with prizes, in Roblox BedWars!\n- The event starts now and ends January 20th (Tuesday), anyone can join!\n- Find the map under customs, the map code is **XLT3-WVI5-GWUS**\n- Watch Slaze\'s YouTube video for the rules and info on how to enter: (the latest video from @SlazeOnTop)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Optimize player block collision checks\n- Custom Match Host Panel now has options to set the weather type, enable / disable passive weather effects (i.e. mushrooms spawning in forest), and enable / disable major weather events (i.e. lightning strikes in rain)\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Snow piles and other replaceable blocks no longer affect player block collisions\n- Fixed kit fusion kits sometimes not properly setting the correct kits\n- Improved lag issues with some weather events\n- Kit mastery tab information correctly reflects kit mastery rank\n\n",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://93116949175834",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
        },
        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 230,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Map Weather Events",
            ["date"] = "1/9/2026",
            ["body"] = "<b>\226\152\128\239\184\143 Map Weather Events</b>\nMaps with the rain, winter, forest, and desert environments now have unique passive mechanics that happen throughout the entire match, and events that happen once per match.\n\226\155\136\239\184\143 Rain Environment\n- Passive: A rainstorm will appear and healing rain clouds spawn around the map.\n- Event: Lightning will strike randomly around the map. There is a warning for where they will strike so you have time to dodge.\n\226\157\132\239\184\143 Winter Environment\n- Passive: Snow will spawn on top of blocks. Mine it to gather throwable snowballs.\n- Event: A snowstorm will appear and blocks would be slippery so watch your step!\n\240\159\140\178 Forest Environment\n- Passive: Mushrooms will spawn around the map. Red heals, blue gives shield, yellow gives a speed boost, and purple gives you an attack boost\226\128\166but also makes you dizzy.\n- Event: Climbable vines will start rapidly growing on walls.\n\240\159\140\181 Desert Environment\n- Passive: Pots will spawn around the map. They will drop loot when you break them.\n- Event: Heavy sandstorms will obstruct your vision and slow your character down.\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\167\153\226\128\141\226\153\130\239\184\143 Zeno\n\240\159\145\187 Spirit Catcher\n\240\159\167\145\226\128\141\240\159\140\190 Farmer Cletus\n\240\159\148\168 Jade\n\n\240\159\142\174 **Playlist Queue**\n\226\158\149 One in the Chamber\n\226\158\150 LuckyBlock One Block\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Player block collisions behavior has been changed to prevent players from placing blocks on players including themselves if the space is less than the player block height.\n- Players are no longer able to fit in spaces that are smaller than their character size. Ex: If a player is 2 blocks tall and there is a one block tall space, the player will no longer be able to \226\128\156glitch\226\128\157 into the 1 block tall space.\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed Lumen and Ember able to charge while using ability\n- Fixed Noelle sometimes unable to give slime\n",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://119064938416779",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
            }
        },
        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 229,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes Week",
            ["date"] = "1/2/2026",
            ["body"] = "\240\159\148\165 <b>2x XP Battle Pass Weekend!</b> Earn twice the amount of battle pass XP in each match\n\n<b>\240\159\143\134 Ranked Season 14</b>\n\226\143\179 Only 2 weeks left in the season!\nSeason 14 wraps up on 01/16/2026, and Season 15 kicks off on 01/23/2026\n\240\159\151\179\239\184\143 Want a say in this season\226\128\153s Victorious Kit Skin? Head to our Discord and vote in #dev-community!\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n\240\159\159\162 Kaida\n- Summon damage increased for first two tiers: (27, 40, 54, 72) \226\134\146 (30, 44, 54, 72)\n- Summon cooldown reduced: 25s \226\134\146 22s\n- Claw damage increased: (22, 28, 42, 54) \226\134\146 (23, 29, 43, 56)\n\240\159\159\161 Yamini\n- Yamini now has a stamina bar, that drains when climbing a wall. At 0 stamina, Yamini dismounts\n- Pounce cooldown reduced: 7.5 seconds \226\134\146 5 seconds\n\240\159\148\180 Ragnar\n- Reduced vertical knockback reduction when enraged: 70% \226\134\146 12%\n- Reduced horizontal knockback reduction when enraged: 70% \226\134\146 40%\n\240\159\148\180 Eldertree\n- Vertical knockback reduction reduced: 5% per orb \226\134\146 1% per orb, max of 15%\n\240\159\148\180 Fisherman\n- Because TNT is now shareable, lowered the drop rate of TNT, particularly in the early-game\n\240\159\148\180 Void Knight\n- When killing a Void Knight, you\'ll now get a bounty relative to their Void Knight progress (this is more of a bug fix, but it results in a nerf)\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\171\149 Alchemist\n\240\159\148\139 Cobalt\n\240\159\152\182\226\128\141\240\159\140\171\239\184\143 Milo\n\240\159\144\157 Lyla (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Sophia can now use Mobile Projectile button to fire frosty mist\n- Bhaa will not spawn after the 20 minute mark in matches\n",
