        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 228,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "New Year\'s 2026 Ball Drop",
            ["date"] = "12/30/2025",
            ["body"] = "The New Year\226\128\153s 2026 Ball Drop mini-event is live!\n\n\240\159\142\134\194\160<b>New Years 2026 Lucky Block</b>\nKeep an eye out for fireworks in your next Lucky Block match! Ring in the New Year with these exciting and explosive items!\n<b>Lucky Block items:</b>\n\240\159\154\128\194\160Firework Rocket Launcher\n\240\159\167\168\194\160Firework Crate\n\240\159\149\186\240\159\143\188\194\160Disco Grenade\n\226\156\168\194\160Sparkler Sword \n\240\159\141\190 Sparkling Cider\n\240\159\142\137\194\160Party Popper\n\n\240\159\170\169 <b>New Years Ball Drop</b>\nA New Years 2026 Ball Drop event will occur in the Lobby & Lucky Block matches every hour until the end of January 2nd!\nParticipate in one of the limited events to receive a badge, 2026 Bed Coins, and exclusive rewards, including the Firework Rocket Launcher lobby gadget!\nCheck the countdown in the lobby to find out when the next drop is.\n",
