        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 227,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "Sophia Kit + Holiday Bundle 2025",
            ["date"] = "12/19/2025",
            ["body"] = "<b>\226\157\132\239\184\143 Sophia Kit</b>\nMeet this year\226\128\153s holiday kit: <b>Sophia the Ice Maiden</b>\nShe wields powerful ice magic to freeze and slow her enemies. Sophia comes equipped with an ice staff that has two modes. One sprays a chilling frost to slows and freezes enemies at max stacks, and the other fires a powerful long ranged ice missile.\n\n<b>\240\159\142\129 Holiday Bundle 2025</b>\nThis bundle works a bit differently from previous years. The Sophia kit is a <b>seasonal kit</b>, available only during the winter season and returning next winter. The cosmetics in this bundle are <b>not exclusive</b>, meaning they may be available again outside of this bundle.\n\226\140\155This bundle expires in 3 weeks on January 9th, 2026. Check out the store to purchase it!\n\n\240\159\148\189 <b>Contents</b>\n\226\157\132\239\184\143 Sophia Kit\n\240\159\148\168 Snow Owl Adetunde Skin\n\226\152\128\239\184\143 Adetunde Kit\n\240\159\144\167 Penguin Queen Taliyah Skin\n\240\159\144\163 Taliyah Kit\n\240\159\167\138 Freezing Staff Lobby Gadget\n\240\159\143\130 Snowboarder Win Effect\n\240\159\148\174 Aurora Blast Kill Effect\n\240\159\155\183 Sleigh Bed Skin\n\240\159\142\132 Festive Bed Skin\n\226\155\184\239\184\143 2 Image Emotes\n\226\155\184\239\184\143 2 Titles\n\240\159\170\153 12,000 Bed Coins\n\n\240\159\155\146 <b>Store Items</b>\nNew store items added to the daily rotation\n- Void Bed\n- Snowman Bed\n- Snowball Rider Win Effect\n\n\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 <b>New Maps</b>\nA bunch of winter themed maps have been added to the map pool!\n- Blossom Winter (Squads)\n- Blossom Winter (Doubles)\n- Blossom Winter (5v5)\n- Champions Valley Winter (5v5)\n- Sanctuary Winter (5v5)\n- Winter (Doubles)\n- Frozen Pond (Doubles)\n- Glade Winter (2v2)\n- Fortress Winter (30v30)\n- Kingdom\'s Garden Winter (30v30)\n- Grandpeak Winter (30v30)\n- Castle Winter (30v30)\n- Winter Aztec (30v30)\n- Winter Aztec (Squads)\n- Winter Aztec (Doubles)\n- Snowy Nordic (Duels)\n- Snowy Nordic (Squads)\n- Snowy Nordic (Doubles)\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\142\133 Santa\n\240\159\148\165 Agni\n\226\155\179 Silas\n\226\155\184\239\184\143 Krystal (Player Level 20 Unlock) (First Time Free!)\n\n\240\159\142\132 <b>Winter Break</b>\nOur team will be on a holiday break, so there won\226\128\153t be a balance update next week. We will be back with a small update on December 30th for the New Year 2026 Ball Drop event \240\159\142\137\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Add improved animated emote previews in locker\n- The Christmas Carol (Animated) emote is now available and free at Battle Pass Level 18\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fix some items appearing in emote previews when they should not\n- Fixed world edit commands incorrectly remeshing blocks\n- Fixed a gifting exploit\n- Fixed Meteor Caller lobby gadget not working\n",
            ["image"] = {
                ["assetId"] = "rbxassetid://85696580808991",
                ["aspectRatio"] = 1,
                ["height"] = 150
