        {
            ["updateLogId"] = 226,
            ["visible"] = true,
            ["title"] = "\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Update + \240\159\148\165 2x XP Weekend",
            ["date"] = "12/12/2025",
            ["body"] = "A new balance update is live! Along with bug fixes and other changes. Tune in next week for a Winter content update Part 2, featuring this year\226\128\153s Winter Kit Bundle with a new kit and tons of cosmetics.\n\n\240\159\148\165 2x XP Battle Pass Weekend! Earn twice the amount of battle pass XP in each match\n\n<b>\226\154\150\239\184\143 Balance Changes</b>\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Eldertree</b>\n- Initial orb spawns: 3 \226\134\146 5\n\240\159\159\162  <b>CrocoWolf</b>\n- Beast damage multiplier: 1.2x \226\134\146 1.25x\n- Beast duration: 7 minutes \226\134\146 6 minutes\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Bounty Hunter</b>\n- Adjusted scaling + loot table values\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Yamini</b>\n- Wall climb speed: 20 \226\134\146 22.5\n- Pounce cooldown: 8s \226\134\146 7.5s\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Xu\'Rot</b>\n- Dragon Form Damage Reduction: 20% \226\134\146 30%\n\240\159\159\162 <b>Frosty</b>\n- Frosty snowball projectile armor penetration multiplier: 10% \226\134\146 75%\n\240\159\159\161  <b>Taliyah</b>\n- Chickens can now be stored in the personal chest\n- Keep half of your chickens on death\n- Chicken price will be less likely above 100 Iron but more likely to be emerald\n- Reduced chicken damage\n    - Iron chicken damage: 11 \226\134\146 9\n    - Diamond Chicken Damage: 13 \226\134\146 11\n    - Emerald Chicken Damage: 15 \226\134\14613\n    - Void Chicken Damage: 18 \226\134\146 16\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Gompy</b>\n- Vacuum ghost capacity: 4 \226\134\1462\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Flora</b>\n- Max beehive grenades: 6 \226\134\146 5\n- Glide duration: 8.5s \226\134\146 7.5s\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Grove</b>\n- Water energy cost per second: 7s \226\134\146 8s\n- Tearbloom Heal per stack: 1.5x \226\134\146 1.25x\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Conqueror</b>\n- Banner price: 50 iron\226\134\146 60 iron\n\240\159\148\180 <b>Martin</b>\n- Slightly reduce max health gain\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\148\165 Pyro\n\240\159\167\153\226\128\141\226\153\130\239\184\143 Whim\n\226\157\132\239\184\143 Yeti\n\240\159\146\168 Zephyr (Player Level 20 unlock)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Updated custom match host panel toggle \226\128\156Ignore Build Restricted Regions\226\128\157. Now ignores map border boundaries when toggled on\n- Added new custom match host panel toggle: \226\128\156Out of bounds damage\226\128\157. Configure whether damage should be applied to players that go outside the map borders.\n- Added achievement for beating Minigame Mountain. Players who already beat minigame mountain will automatically receive this.\n- Added suspense music and a countdown when nearing sudden death in Bed Wars matches\n- Added a new background music track that plays after sudden death or when the amount of alive teams is low\n- Fixed settings fields not applying on the first edit\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed snowboard Lobby Gadget noise\n- No longer show purchasable tool tip on limited kits\n- Fixed Void Knight decaying themselves\n- Fixed Locker UI sometimes stuck on screen\n- Fixed Armor Trim XP boosts in the Locker UI, so they no longer stack and you can see their individual expire times\n- A series of fixed to Mini Game mountains, including:\n    - Fixed Adetunde kit not being rewarded for beating Minigame Mountain. Players who already beat minigame mountain will receive Adetunde kit\n    - Boss hit box improvement\n    - Boss area suffocating player\n    - Multiple Mini-games going on at the same time\n    - Mini-games sometimes not ending properly\n    - Added Avalanche to kill feed\n    - Fixed spectators sometimes being stuck in first person\n- Fixed player party invite not properly updating when new player row is added\n",
