            ["title"] = "\240\159\143\130 Winter Update + Holiday Battle Pass",
            ["date"] = "12/05/2025",
            ["body"] = "\240\159\143\148\239\184\143 <b>Minigame Mountain (LTM)</b>\nMinigame mountain is back with a new minigame and rewards for conquering the summit! As a team of 4 you will compete in minigames as you try to reach the summit of the mountain!\n\n<b>\240\159\143\130 Snowboarding Minigame</b>\n Race down the mountain on snowboards while dodging obstacles and escaping an avalanche in this new addition to Minigame Mountain!\n\n\240\159\142\129 <b>Rewards</b>\n- Beat Minigame Mountain to receive an exclusive Gift-Wrapped Snowboard Lobby Gadget and Game Badge\n\n\240\159\142\159\239\184\143 <b>Holiday Battle Pass</b>\nWe\226\128\153ve dropped a battle pass for the Holiday season! This event runs for 5 weeks and is packed with 30 levels of rewards. This battle pass also debuts some new reward types!\n\n\240\159\154\168 <b>Important Note</b>\nWe\226\128\153re shifting toward less exclusive content, which means this Battlepass\226\128\153s cosmetics aren\226\128\153t locked forever. They will have a chance to appear in the rotating shop after 3 months.\n\n\240\159\134\149 <b>New Reward Types</b>\n- Kit Skin Crates\n- Kit Skin Crate Fragment (Collect 10 to craft a kit skin crate)\n- Armor Trim XP Multipliers\n\n\240\159\142\129 <b>Holiday Check-in (Free Gifts!)</b>\n25 Days of gifts! Log in everyday to receive your free rewards.\n\n\226\154\148\239\184\143 <b>Winter Limited Time Items</b>\nAdded Winter limited time items to the random pool in Bed Wars queues\n- Snowball Launcher\n- Hot Chocolate\n- Frozen Fortress\n\n<b>\240\159\134\147 Free Kits</b>\n\240\159\167\138 Freiya\n\226\155\132 Frosty\n\240\159\141\170 Gingerbread Man\n\240\159\166\139 Aery (Player Level 20 Unlock)\n\n<b>\240\159\142\174 Queue Changes</b>\n- Added Mine Wars to Arcade queues rotation\n- Enabled Minigame Mountain\n\n<b>\240\159\151\186\239\184\143 Maps</b>\nTo get into the winter spirit, we\226\128\153ve brought back a bunch of winter maps and added some new ones too.\n<b>New Maps</b>\n\226\155\132 Snowman Park (Sky Wars, Duels, Squads, Doubles)\n\240\159\165\182 Frosty Woods (Sky Wars)\n\240\159\141\132 Fungi Land (Squads, Doubles)\n<b>Returning Maps</b>\n- Christmas Square (Doubles, Squads)\n- Nordic (Squads)\n- Frostbite (Squads)\n- Glacial Fort (Squads)\n- Snow Lodge (Duels)\n- Christmas (Duels)\n- Festive (16v16)\n\n\240\159\148\167 <b>Other Changes</b>\n- Diamond Guardians and Titan now have Christmas Skins\n- Improvements to locker ui and preview\n    - Most lobby gadget items can now be previewed\n    - Can now rotate preview directly in locker\n    - Can now click on certain shop items to preview them\n- The \226\128\156Frosty\226\128\157 armor trim has returned, with double the chances to unlock it compared to other armor trims\n- New Holiday Lobby\n\n\240\159\144\155 <b>Bug Fixes</b>\n- Fixed locker UI not reverting to original environment\n- Fixed spawning into the ground in lobby\n- Fixed Lightning Strike bed break effect preview\n- Fixed Sheila not losing stacks on death\n- Fixed missing blocks in certain maps: Tundra, Pinefall (Squads, Doubles), Farmland (5v5, Duels), Autumn, Arch (Squads, Doubles), Training Room, etc.\n- Fixed reconnecting as Aery not saving butterfly stacks\n- Fixed not being able to control movements of certain Win Effect\n- Fixed Conqueror fire banner overriding fire enchant duration\n- Fix hitting through Conqueror flags\n- Fixed Dragon Sword JiangShi sword visuals\n",
